  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2804.06 Scope of Administrative Review or Hearing. The scope of the administrative review or hearing shall be limited to those grounds set forth in RSA 265-A:31, II(a)-(f).\n\nSource. #5538, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6716, INTERIM, eff 4-1-98, EXPIRES: 7-30-98; ss by #6824, eff 7-28-98; ss by #8666, INTERIM, eff 7-16-06, EXPIRES: 1-12-07; ss by #8782-A, eff 1-1-07; ss by #10888, eff 7-16-15",
